menu "APEX reviewed laboratory target"
config APEX_REVIEWED_BLE_BENCH_OPT_IN
    bool "Enable unauthenticated BLE laboratory transport"
    default n
    help
        Starts the NimBLE host and connectable advertising when the USB loop
        calls apex_ble_start. For separately authorized owned-bench use only.
        Selecting this is not permission to flash or operate a radio.
endmenu
